      "name": "Resonant Vessels (Except While in Shattered Form)",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The jinn's jars vibrate violently when exposed to loud sounds, disrupting the flow of its power. If the jinn takes 20+ Thunder damage on a single turn, the Fire, Lightning, Necrotic, and Radiant damage it deals is halved until it finishes a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
